window.products.push({"id":471036,"name":"Netimune Coffee Mat, Coffee Maker Mat for Countertops, 24''x 16'' Hide Stain Quick Drying Coffee Mat, Dish Drying Mat for Kitchen Counter, Anti-Slip C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TktVanVLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Always Keep the Countertop Clean and Tidy】：The coffee machine mat made of special PU leather surfaces hide coffee stains, milk stains, and any other dark messy stains. Coffee maker mat for countertops no need to clean frequently because hide stains well. Avoid the trouble of cleaning the countertops. 🍽️【Also A Dish Drying Mat】: Each kitchen counter mat measures 24x16 inches, which is larger than ordinary draining mats and can hold large pots, pans, and more dishes. The amazingly absorbent drying mat is thick enough to better protect countertops, tableware, and glassware from damage and contamination. Dishmats are perfect for kitchen counters and bathroom countertops. 🍷【Super Absorbent Dish Drying Mat for the Kitchen】：Coffee bar mat have super absorbent soft diatomite that can suck up spilled coffee instantly. Coffee drying mats for countertop wipe easily, durable, light weight. Protect expensive kitchen tabletops from coffee splashes or coffee bean stains. 🍸【Anti-slip Waterproof Coffee Mat】：It's non-slip, waterproof and heat-proof (The temperature cannot exceed 158℉). The rubber backing bottom of the coffee maker mat for countertops has a good anti-slip effect. The anti-slip bottom will be absorbed on the table to prevent it from moving. The waterproof bottom can prevent spilled liquid from damaging the tabletop, keep countertop dry and tidy. 🍹【Easy Clean & Quick Dry】：Absorbent coffee bar mat no need to clean frequently because hide stains well. Only wash it every two weeks. Coffee maker mat for countertops will not fade or wrinkle. Coffee machine mat can be washed by hand, dry naturally, but do not bleach. 🍻【Wide Use】：Under coffee maker mat can be used for any small home household appliances indoors. For example, cups ,mixer，airfryer,blender,oven,toaster,etc. It's easy storage and carrying. It’s more than a coffee mat. Also can be widely used as dish drying mat for dishes and cups in kitchen, bar and bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TktVanVLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Netimune","source_asin":"B0BLS7KVFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLS7KVFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLS7KVFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
