window.products.push({"id":471108,"name":"Alpine Industries 25 Pcs Acrylic Tent Style Table Numbers, 3\"x3\" (Numbered 76 Through 100)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bT0Kaw1IL._AC_SL1437_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE USE. Getting multiple guests seated quickly is made simple with these attractively designed, easily read table numbers. They’re great for crowded restaurants, banquet and reception halls, and individuals who often host large parties and events. When everyone is arriving at the same time, the greeter can simply tell them to make their way to their table. HIGH-QUALITY, DURABLE CONSTRUCTION. Expertly made using durable, acrylic material, these table numbers will supply long-lasting strength and use throughout the years. Although acrylic is lightweight, it boasts great strength, is shatter-resistant and won’t break even if it hits the ground! Plus, the material is easy to clean when needed. GENEROUSLY SIZED. Measuring 3” H x 3” W x 2.7” D, these acrylic numbers are easy enough to read yet not space-intrusive when placed on a crowded table. It’s the perfect way for guests to identify what table they are sitting at when attending a wedding, shower, graduation, anniversary party or another special occasion. SIMPLE YET STYLISH DESIGN. Popping against a white background, the large, black numbers are easy to see when guests are trying to locate their tables. The slanted orientation furnishes a clear, unobstructed view, while numbers on both sides allow you to find your table from either direction. 25-COUNT PACKAGE. For added convenience, these table numbers are sold in 25-number lots up to 100 to match your table count. This allows you to purchase what you need without having several numbers left over that you will never use. **Prop 65 Warning - Lead and DEHP**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bT0Kaw1IL._AC_SL1437_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpine Industries","source_asin":"B09Z5F6CR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z5F6CR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z5F6CR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
