window.products.push({"id":471127,"name":"Nawrap Printed Dishcloth, Made in Japan, 6 Ply, Soft, Durable, and Absorbent, 13.5 x 16 in - Dog Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ya8IhTl6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Printed dishcloth with a dog design 6 ply for extra absorbency and durability. Traditional Japanese weave and construction allows the fabric to become softer and more absorbent with use. Micro pulls form on the outer layer of the dishcloth, creating a softer feel over time. Its special weave pattern ensures pulls do not spread. Fabric is stiff at first but will become incredibly soft with use. To achieve softness faster, soak in hot water. The feel and texture of this fabric is different from your typical dishcloth. Dishcloth is washing machine safe but color will slightly fade and cloth will shrink by about 10 to 15% after first wash - Please do not put in the dryer Material: 100% rayon - One dishcloth included - Dimensions: 13.5 x 16 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ya8IhTl6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nawrap","source_asin":"B01DTZHDUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DTZHDUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DTZHDUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471128,"name":"Couch Cup Holder, Yeeper Sofa Non-Toxic & Anti-Slip Design, Silicone Couch Cup Coaster Tray for Arm Chair Couch, Armrest Remote Control and Cellphone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5133dt-gLoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"| YOU NEED A COUCH DRINK HOLDER | - Lounging on the couch can be a small luxury, but keeping that couch looking clean and clutter-free can be a challenge. Yeeper couch cup holder don’t just keep your couch looking great, they can also make everyday lounging on (or working from) the couch more comfortable. Whether you’re looking for ways to securely hold drinks or devices, or keep track of essentials like remotes and eyeglasses, this couch cup holder that can help. | QUALITY MATTERS | - An important reason why many consumers choose us is that our couch holders are made of food-grade silicone materials and have passed the authoritative test report (TEST REPORT NO: CTT2006013752EN). Compared with other non-food grade products, it has the following characteristics, it does not contain any toxic substances, does not have any odor, and will not age and fade over time and it will not leave any marks on the sofa after use. | REDEFINE THE ANTI-SKID SYSTEM | - Most of the products on the market achieve the anti-slip effect by increasing the back texture of couch drinks holder, However, due to the insufficient weight of the product itself, we can still often see customers complaint. For this reason, we add four counterweight iron blocks at each corner of the couch holder, and the overall weight reached 2.2 pounds. We can proudly say that this sofa drink holder with the best anti-slip effect available on the market. | COMPATIBLE ANY SIZE CUP | - Many Couch drink holders on the market can only hold cups of a fixed size. Yepper couch drink holder has designed a silicone card slot that automatically adapts to the size of the cup. No matter the size of your cup (maximum support 3.5\"), it can hold firmly. NOTE: This sofa coaster is recommended for use on a 15cm wide sofa. Not for sofa which arm width less than 5.9\". | SATISFACTION GUARANTEED, WE GUARANTEE IT | - Yeeper is committed to designing and producing high-quality accessories for drink enthusiasts.We're so confident you'll absolutely LOVE your new couch cup holder that we fully stand behind it with an INDUSTRY LEADING, LIFETIME ‘NO QUESTIONS ASKED’ WARRANTY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5133dt-gLoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yeeper","source_asin":"B095P8PGL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095P8PGL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095P8PGL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
