window.products.push({"id":471238,"name":"The Humble Brand Artificial Pampas Grass - Boho Decor for Flower Arrangements, Vases - Fluffy Faux Plumes, No Shedding - Ideal for Home Decorating, We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nZDil4TjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for gorgeous and fluffy faux pampas? If you want to spruce up your living space but don’t like dealing with the shedding of naturally dried pampas grass, then getting artificial ones may be the best option especially if you have sensitivities to allergens or pollen. With this decorative bundle, styling up your space has never been easier. These tall artificial pampas generally last longer and require little to no maintenance. They also save you the trouble of dealing with the mess of shedding plumes. Add a chic boho vibe to your home interior with the Artificial Pampas Grass by The Humble Brand! Make a beautiful statement and decorate any area or room using our faux pampas grass set which includes three long and stylish stems of pampas grass (4 ft. tall with 2.4 ft. stem) that flaunt a realistic white and beige color. Unlike their natural counterparts, these artificial pampas grass stems won’t easily fade nor shed their plume. They also do not have pollen, making it excellent and safe for people who are prone to irritation from allergens. Each of these ornamental items showcases a stunning plume that will elevate the visual aesthetic of your space. No need to use sunlight to plump it up! Just place them in a vase on their own or with an elaborate floral arrangement and enjoy their ethereal fluffiness. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons to choose our realistic pampas grass: Bend, cut, or tailor the stems to fit any vase A great backdrop for weddings, themed parties, or photoshoots Place it on tabletops, shelves, and beside mirrors Furnish your home with everlasting pampas grass. Add The Humble Brand Artificial Pampas Grass to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nZDil4TjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THB","source_asin":"B091TZKSQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TZKSQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TZKSQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
