window.products.push({"id":471248,"name":"MEIYA Tumbler with Lid and Straw, Glass Water Bottle, Smoothie Cup, Mason Jar Cups for Ice Coffee, Tea, Soda and Water, 16 oz Gray Drinking Jar with B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314nkpwGgoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🧉【ECO-FRIENDLY】：Our mason jar cups is eco-friendly and made of non-plastic and durable materials. All products are independently tested, ensuring each design is 100% safe for your children and the environment. We can together end the use of single-use plastics, and contribute to the protection of the earth. 🧉【LEAKPROOF】：Our glass tumbler with lid and straw has leak-proof design, the silicone ring around the bamboo cover can effectively fasten the lid and there is also a silicone ring between lid and straw to fill the gap between them to prevent the drink in the smoothie cup from leaking out, so that you can use it even during your driving. 🧉【SILICONE SLEEVE】：Our glass water bottle has a silicone sleeve, which offers a large surface area for a sure grip with no-slip. The bonus of the silicone sleeve is it also offers some insulation for keeping your drink hot or cold longer. What’s more, it can also protect the drinking jar from impact, so that your glass tumbler will not easily to broken. 🧉【EASY TO CLEAN】：The MEIYA glass tumbler with lid and straw is easy to clean. We provide straw cleaner, so that you can clean the inside of straw where is difficult to clean. And remember to keep dry after washing to avoid mildew. A convenient-to-clean coffee tumbler means your drinking health is guaranteed. 🧉【HIGH QUALITY】：Our glass tumbler cups is made of non-toxic and BPA free material to protect your drinking safety. The glass cup is made up of 100% borosilicate glass, and the straw and lid are made of premium quality bamboo material, biodegradable and safe to use. If you have any questions, please contact with us, we are glad to solve your problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314nkpwGgoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEIYA","source_asin":"B09HBL9Y7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HBL9Y7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HBL9Y7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
