window.products.push({"id":471308,"name":"Gmhehly LED Round Bathroom Vanity Mirror with Motion Sensor, 24 Inch Circle Frame Wall Mirror with Anti-Fog,High Lume and Brightness Memory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+IKWZsJHL._AC_.jpg","description":"【High CRI LED Light】This LED bathroom vanity mirror compared with conventional mirror, this 5mm copper free silver mirror that will give you 35% more clarity. The CRI of over 95 ensures perfect color rendering and makes these lights a perfect fit for all those chores looking for accurate color discrimination. 【Smart Design】Built-in hand motion sensor in the side of the bathroom mirror . When you hand wave to the sensor(less than 10cm distance), the light of the mirror will turn on /off automatically. IP67 waterproof rating is ideal for using over a sink or in a steamy statement. Explosion-proof film is stick on the back of mirror to protect your family away from broken glass when the mirror damaged by accident. 【Anti-Fogged and Automatic Shutdown】 Built-in anti-fog pad ensures the mirror stays clear and fog-free after shower. The mirror defogger switch and light switch can be controlled separately, safe and energy-saving. The anti-fog of the mirror would be turned off automatically after one hour of using . You never worry about whether you turn off anti-fog function . 【Dimmable Light and Brightness Memory】This LED mirror for bathroom has 3 color temperature lights : 2700K, 4500K and 6000K. The brightness of the light can be adjusted from 10% to 100% using the touch sensor button on mirror. Memory function allows the last light temperature and brightness setting to be recalled when you turn on the switch. Avoid the trouble of repeatedly adjusting. 【Long Lifetime and Easy Installation】This round mirror feature high quality. Power supply and LED lights are UL listed which have more than 50,000 hours lifespan. You can forget about replacing the lights again and again. Using U shape hanger, you can install the mirror easily in less than 20 minutes. If there are any problem with the mirror, please feel free to contact us. We will solve all questions within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+IKWZsJHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gmhehly","source_asin":"B095P419GN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095P419GN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095P419GN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
