window.products.push({"id":471423,"name":"Urbanest Colette Decor Drapery Medallion Holdback, 1 Pcs (Burnt Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8121nsjfNbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand New Urbanest Window Drapery Medallion Holdback. Medallion measures 3 1/4 inch in diameter; Base measures 2 1/2 inch in diameter.Projection from wall is 4 1/2 inch. Our drapery medallion holdbacks are great to use as a traditional holdback. You can also use them instead of a curtain rod to attach a curtain valance or curtain panel to the wall. Mounting hardware included for easy installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8121nsjfNbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urbanest","source_asin":"B00ESHDWO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ESHDWO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ESHDWO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471424,"name":"Shavel Home Products All Seasons Year Round Sheet Blanket with Satin Hem, Queen, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s9eb2bKxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our innovative Micro Flannel all seasons satin hemmed sheet blanket creates a gentle \"micro climate\" of comfort all around you. Perfect for the warmer months, air-conditioned homes, or as an additional layer in the fall/winter seasons; Micro Flannel does not pill or shrink and is machine wash and dry. This blanket combines the luxurious softness of European cotton flannel with the easy care of polyester fleece-all without the bulk. This sheet blanket is made of 100 percent micro flannel polyester. Micro Flannel is a registered trademark of Shavel Home Products (patent pending).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s9eb2bKxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shavel Home Products","source_asin":"B00MXRIGJA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MXRIGJA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MXRIGJA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471425,"name":"Magnetic Beer Bottle Opener Wall Mounted, Vintage Beer Gifts for Men Dad, Wooden Magnetic Bottle Opener for Fridge, Cool Housewarming Gift, Fathers St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Az-PtzVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gifts For Him: This red rosewood wall-mounted beer opener is an ideal choice as Father's Day gifts from wife or daughter. For the beer-loving man in your life, whether he is your husband, boyfriend, fiance, stepdad, dad, brother, or beer-brewing friend. This unique gift is sure to be a valued addition to any man cave. Hassel-Free Functionality: This unique wall mounted bottle opener was artisanally crafted with durable zinc alloy that pops the beer and soda caps right off. Gone are the days of digging around for a bottle opener. You can quickly open any beer with one hand, and the auto-catch function conveniently catches up to 30 loose caps for a cool, laidback experience. Hanging And Assembly: Our premium rosewood rustic wall mount bottle opener comes with strong backside magnets for metal surfaces like refrigerators and long screws with plugs for mounting on any wall. In your beer bottle opener gift package, you will get a cool screwdriver featuring the American flag for easy assembly. High-quality materials: Looking to add that vintage touch to your kitchen or spruce up a room with bar decor? Our Premium Bottle opener wall mount features a rustic wood piece with funny quotes. You can hang it on the side of your bar counter or attach it firmly to a beer fridge using the three high-performance N35 Neodymium magnets. In your package: Each beer lover gift box includes: 1x Wooden magnetic beer bottle opener, 1x Zinc alloy capsule opener opener, 1x Screwdriver with American Flag, 4x long screws with plugs, and 4x short screws. Moreover, your satisfaction is our top priority. If you have any questions about your mounted wall bottle opener, don't hesitate to contact us, we are here to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Az-PtzVQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premiumswede","source_asin":"B0BVXB2MYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVXB2MYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVXB2MYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471426,"name":"Windmill Mints Chocolate Candy Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sg1Jqbd+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sg1Jqbd+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EDW0HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EDW0HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EDW0HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
