window.products.push({"id":471460,"name":"Kitchen Island On Wheels Cart With Storage Cabinet and Drawers Wood Shelves (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51drrJaybLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Why wait to finally have that extra space you have been needing in your kitchen while adding a stylish flare back into your kitchen and home? Why Premium Kitchen USA are superior to similar products: - You will be amazed at the durability and sturdiness of your new kitchen island. Made using top quality metal components, tropical hardwood, and wood composites. Your kitchen cart is designed for many years of tough use.  - Easily move your kitchen island on wheels to anywhere in your house without the need of heavy lifting. The quality metal castors make it easy to quickly move your kitchen cart to make cleaning your floor a breeze. Simply lock the wheels in place to ensure stability when done.  - Finally you will have that extra storage space you have been needing to declutter your kitchen table! You new kitchen cart has spacious storage with 1 large utility drawer, 2 door cabinet with an adjustable shelf, and a stylish spice rack.  - Your guests will be amazed with your new portable kitchen island. Match your kitchen with any of our 3 stylish yet practical colors: Red, White, and Black. The spacious storage, spice rack, towel rack, and tropical hardwood table top make this kitchen island extremely practical without sacrificing its amazing style. Overall dimensions: 34.5 inches high x 35.5 inches wide x 17.6 inches deep Cart top: 31.25 inches wide x 17.6 inches deep Drawer: 2.5 inches high x 20.75 inches wide x 10.5 inches deep Inside the cabinet overall: 23.75 inches high x 21.5 inches wide x 13.6 inches deep We have a no hassle 100% guarantee refund policy. If you use this and do not love it, simply return it for a full refund. You have nothing to lose. Consider picking up an extra cart for double the storage space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51drrJaybLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Kitchen USA","source_asin":"B07F215JWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F215JWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F215JWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471461,"name":"Wildkin Wooden Two-Step Stool for Kids and Adults, Perfect Kitchen Step Stool or Bathroom Potty Stool, Kids Stepping Stool Features Two Convenient Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tEOYQ5-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DISCOVER WILDKIN’S UNIQUE COLLECTIONS Wildkin is a privately owned business located in Nashville Tennessee. We offer fantastic backpacks, lunch boxes, sleeping bags, bedding and more for all ages! Your kids will love our designs and you'll love our quality and pricing! We make useful fun safe gear for kids of all ages and our colorful bags and other items are designed to be both super-safe and very useful. We offer excellent quality non-toxic products With our coordinating accessories you can mix and match our high-quality and unique boys comforter sets girls comforter sets kids sheet sets kids pillows. Coordinating to our kids bedding are clocks lamps and rugs Not only does Wildkin offer the finest in fun kids bedding but also a full line of kids gear including sleeping bags backpacks and lunch bags Wildkin bedding gear and room decor offer the best in quality at a reasonable price OUR PRODUCT Wildkin’s two step stool wood design is the perfect addition to homes with little ones looking to reach new heights. Measuring 15.25 x 13 x 14.1 inches, this toddler step stool is perfect for all those times your child needs a boost. Whether they’re brushing their teeth before bedtime or helping you make dinner at the kitchen counter, this stool two step gives them the leg up they need. If you’re looking for a wooden step stool that complements your home instead of competing with it, look no further. The classic design of Wildkin’s Two Step Stool means it will fit seamlessly into your existing home decor. This step stool is sleek and lightweight, so you can easily tuck it away when not in use. This Wildkin’s Two step stool for kids is also an excellent gift idea for any event like Friendship Day, Independence Day, Mother's Day, Grandparent's Day, Parent's Day, New Year's Day, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas Day. Great presents not only for little ones but for people of all ages as well. PRODUCT CARE INSTRUCTIONS Wildkin’s kids step stool are designed specifically for big kids, little kids, toddlers and adults too. With proper care, our Wildkin wood step stool will last a long time. To clean the toddler kitchen stool, you can maintain sparkling design by cleaning it every week. You can best accomplish this by just using a cloth and soapy water. Wash the kitchen step stool carefully then rinse off all the soap before letting them dry completely. 90 DAYS WARRANTY AGAINST DEFECTSWe aim for a happy customer experience! All of our products feature a 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-safe, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tEOYQ5-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B08G1QCQJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G1QCQJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G1QCQJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
