window.products.push({"id":471614,"name":"Vestaware Toaster Oven, 27QT Hot Convection & Rotisserie Oven with 10 Presets & 6 Accessories, Baking Pan Broil Rack Rotisserie Fork and Crumb Tray, N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YgyT+8QGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONVECTION HEATING - Equipped with a total of 4 heating elements at the top and bottom that provide 1500W of heating power and a built-in convection fan, uses convection heating technology to circulate warm air throughout the appliance for quickly and evenly baking or cooking, just where and when you want it for perfect results every time. PREMIUM FEATURES - Featured with a digital LCD display with easy to use controls that allows you to set temperature from 150°F to 450°F and time from 1min to 2 hours, also choose from 10 different cooking functions that includes Toast, Bake, Broil, Pizza, Cookies, Defrost, Reheat, Rotisserie, Keep Warm or Convection. You can do so much more with this convection oven. SMART CONTROLLER & USEFUL ACCESSORIES - Easy to use control knobs helps to toast food to your liking, just simply rotating to adjust temperature and time. stylish stainless steel toaster oven with a brushed and matte finish that is easy to clean & use. LARGE CAPACITY - This 4-slice countertop oven is big enough for household use, 3 flexible rack positions that give you total control over how you place your pans, can comfortably fit a 10 inch pizza, 12 chicken wings, 6 slice of bread, 8 muffins or a small rotisserie chicken, please refer to the accessories position diagrams to place the accessories with food carefully. PACKAGE AND SERVICE: Versatile accessories includes durable baking rack, grill tray, rotisserie fork, crumb tray, helper handle, rack clamp, can easily meet different cooking needs. Vestaware provides One-Year replacement and 24-hour customer friendly service. If you receive defective products or are not satisfied with them, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YgyT+8QGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vestaware","source_asin":"B081YSG5D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081YSG5D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081YSG5D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
