window.products.push({"id":471626,"name":"Joyreap 3 Piece Duvet Cover Set Full/Queen, Luxury Blue Satin Silky Microfiber Duvet Cover, Ultra Soft and Smooth Comforter Cover for All Season, Bedd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dpjjmQWcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LUXURY DUVET COVER 3PCS SET: 1 duvet cover(90\" x 90\")/ NO COMFORTER+ 2 pillow cases(20\"x 26\")/ NO PILLOW CORE [Blue, Queen] HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL- Made of 100% polyester, super soft, smooth and breathable, keeps you comfortable all night (especially if you like naked sleeping). MODERN DESIGN- Duvet cover with hidden zipper closure, four interior corner ties keep the duvet in place. Envelope pillow shams for easily removing or inserting your pillows. EASY CARE - Hand wash or gentle machine wash in low temperature. Tumble dry low, iron on lowest setting as needed. ATTENTIVE SERVICE: Any question about our product is welcome, all your message can be replied in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dpjjmQWcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyreap","source_asin":"B07R5NGY21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R5NGY21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R5NGY21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471627,"name":"HOMESPON Bento Box Adult Lunch Box with Bag, 3-Tier Bento Lunch Containers for Adults, Reusable Spoon/Fork & Dressing Box Leakproof Lunchbox for Work,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MNMexpO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Applicability and capacity: HOMESPON Bento Box Adult Lunch Box is intended to provide convenience for work, travel, exercise, camping,The salad dressing container has three layers, each layer capacity can reach 20oz. You can carry various fruits and vegetables or dry food separately. You can choose to use only one layer or two layers. HOMESPON lunch boxes can meet most of your needs for taking meals out. Package content: This bento box comes with a lunch bag, which is convenient for you to carry around. We also equip you with a set of reusable spoons and forks made of wheat straw. There are also two food-grade salad dressing boxes that can be boiled at high temperature. You can put two different flavors of salad dressing according to your needs. The salad dressing box can also contain some complementary foods or granular food. It can be the best Valentine's Dayr gifts. Regarding heat preservation: Our bento box itself has no heat preservation effect, mainly for storing salads. However, the meal bag (Felt + foil design) in our set has a certain thermal insulation effect, and when used together, it can provide you with a 1-2 hours temperature guarantee for the heated food you prepare. Performance and attention: The stainless steel inner container of our lunch box can be taken out and has a reserved space at the bottom and easier to clean. When you need to heat food, you can take out the inner container and pour hot water underneath to heat the food. You can also choose to heat it in the microwave but please notice the inner can not be heated separately, it needs to be matched with the outer layer . Please do not store hot water under the tank while carrying. After-sales service: Because the lunch box may be damaged during transportation, please check the product carefully after receiving the goods. If there is any problem, contact us as soon as possible. We provide you with return or exchange service, after testing, we found that the outer layer made of PC material is easy to break, so we specially replaced PP food grade material for you to ensure the quality of your lunch box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MNMexpO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMESPON","source_asin":"B08RS8FT54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RS8FT54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RS8FT54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471628,"name":"Eiyye Handmade Wall Hanging Fringe Panels Garland Banner Woven Tapestry Cotton Crochet Decor Macrame Bohemian Art Decor (5-flag)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F3DeZDN1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design 5 flag shape with tassel pattern and long fringe, this garland definitely add elegance to your home. Perfect to add a boho or art vibe. Great Gift Choice This macrame is thick woven and well-made, perfect to add a bohemian or art vibe. Ideal gift for a person who enjoys bohemian, nordic or ethnic style in their home. Specifications Material: Cotton Dimension: Total length of garland: 29inches Weight: 6.3ounces/piece Package -1 x wall hanging About COLOR & SIZE Variation 1.Color: All of our images are real shot. Due to light and monitor display difference, it is normal to have a little color variation. 2.Size: Because of the different measurement methods, knitting process and or product extensibility, there might be 1-2cm variation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F3DeZDN1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eiyye","source_asin":"B09V7LDL7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V7LDL7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V7LDL7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
