window.products.push({"id":471785,"name":"Sudopo, Ergonomic Lumbar Support Home Task, Adjustable Headrest and Armrests Big Office, Breathable Mesh Back Computer Chair,Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d3StnhMHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ERGONOMIC HOME OFFICE CHAIR 】 SUDOPO Office Chair has an S-curve backrest designed according to the curve of the human spine. This desk chair is designed with four gears adjustment lumber support according to different heights, which can relieve the back pressure caused by long-term sitting so that you will not feel back pain after long hours of work. 【HIGH QUALITY DESK CHAIR】The headrest and backrest of the office chair are shaped like a fishnet, which comfortably supports the back of a long-time worker. The office chair seat cushion adopts a highly flexible curved design that keeps you cool throughout the day, helping you work more efficiently. Lower back adjust lumbar support to keep your back and thighs posture perfect. 【360°ROLLING NYLON WHEELS】SUDOPO home office chair has a 360° rolling wheels swivel function that provides freedom of movement and convenience when rolling it in any direction. Five universal soft PU material casters protect your favourite hardwood floor, carpets and other mats, ensuring smooth moving on any surface. 【ADJUSTABLE PU ARMRESTS】Our armrests with more extensive, thicker & softer PU padding are the best to fit your various seating position. The armrests can be adjusted in height from 24.4-31.1\", meeting people with different needs. The ergonomic desk chair with wheels focuses on every detail to fit your personal needs, whether working, studying or resting. The high-back office chair provides long hours of comfortable. 【STURDY AND EASY TO INSTALL】 - Our tall office chair with a heavy-duty, durable base can support up to 300lbs of grown people. Certified by BIFMA and SGSA, a comfortable PU armrest task chair support your body on a superior level. An ergonomic lab chair comes with all the hardware and necessary tools. Most people can finish its installation within 20 minutes by following our assemble video or instructions. 【5 YEARS WARRANTY】We provide five years of after-sales guarantee! If there are missing parts, product damage, or other unsatisfactory issues, Don't hesitate to contact us in time. We will reply to you within 24 hours and actively solve them. Thank you for choosing the SUDOPO office chair. We will be responsible for your choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d3StnhMHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sudopo","source_asin":"B0B12DZG68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B12DZG68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B12DZG68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
