window.products.push({"id":471860,"name":"10 Beach Wedding Favors Sunglasses Personalized, Beach Wedding Favors for Guests, Custom Birthday Bachelorette Graduation Party Favors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtI7DcW0L._AC_SL1190_.jpg","description":"Each set contains 10 Custom Beach Wedding Favors Sunglasses. Sunglasses are adult size. Made from plastic with a rubber coat that ensures long lasting durability. UV400 Lenses Provide 100% UVA And UVB Protection. Unlimited Customization: Mix any colored frame to form your set. Graphics & Font - Pick from our options charts. Unless font is specified in order, we will print using the best font for your wedding favors personalized sunglasses frame colors. How to Personalize Sunglasses: Please send us a message with your customization details (as shown below) after placing order.  -- Frame & Print Colors - Picked from our Charts -- Print - Max 30 characters (including spaces) -- Icon Color & Name - Picked from Icon Chart -- Additional Details (frame colors, text for different frames, 2 side print, etc..) Example To order 8 navy wedding favors sunglasses with white print and 12 white personalized sunglasses with navy print (Order 2 sets of custom sunglasses), send message as shown below:  -- White print on 8 Navy Glasses + Navy print on 12 White Glasses -- Print - Lisa & Michael (gold starfish icon) 07.20.2015 -- One white frame for bride with navy print \"Bride\". FREE Proofs For orders over 40 pieces, ONLY upon request we will provide proof of your print on the sunglasses. Wrong Print If there's a mistake in print delivered, then we will only send replacement stickers by First Class Mail (not expedited shipping methods). FREE assembly provided for glasses delivered cannot be used to get refunds. You will have to apply the replacement stickers.  If glasses can be returned (we will pay for return shipping) then we will send them back with correct print applied on all glasses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtI7DcW0L._AC_SL1190_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beach wedding favors sunglasses","source_asin":"B071SF5M6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071SF5M6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071SF5M6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
