window.products.push({"id":471871,"name":"Alligator on The Beach Glass Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PPHeNGrhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3.12 Inches x 3.12 Inches x 5.24 Inches 7.9 cm x 7.9 cm x 13.3 cm Glass Hand Painted Mouth Blown Glittered Accents Gift Boxed Animal-themed ornaments are a popular choice for Christmas decorations. From glass puppies and kittens to hand-painted deer and bears, there is an ornament to suit every taste. Animal lovers will appreciate the wide selection of animal-themed ornaments available and the fact that they can show off their love of animals during the holiday season. While Christmas is a time for family and friends, it also shows your love for the animal kingdom. So whether you choose a hand-painted bear or puppy, make sure to include an animal-themed ornament on your Christmas tree this year. Each of our ornaments is meticulously crafted by hand using traditional techniques that originated in the 1800's. The Renaissance-era carving, molding, glass blowing, silver lining, painting and finishing processes require unparalleled skill and several weeks to complete.The molten glass is mouth-blown into finely carved molds to shape the ornament. It is then painted and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve the beautiful final products. Exquisite workmanship and details are the hallmarks of all BestPysanky ornaments. We aim to bring warmth, color, spirit and sparkle into your home with our unique decor, as you admire and celebrate the holidays with your loved ones. It's more than just an ornament- it's a work of art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PPHeNGrhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B07H7B7MJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H7B7MJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H7B7MJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":471872,"name":"Willow Tree Thinking of You Ornament, Sculpted Hand-Painted Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614XXJyPSJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Sentiment: ”Keeping you close in my thoughts” written on hangtag 4.5\"h hand-painted resin ornament of angel in cream dress with wire wings, holding pink conch shell up to ear. Ornaments are smaller-sized versions of the most-loved Willow Tree angels and figures, with brown elastic cord for hanging. For Holidays or for Everyday, Ornaments are gifts for engagements, weddings, new babies, graduations, teachers, birthdays... an expression of love and appreciation that celebrates life's milestones in a small, commemorative format. Packaged in fitted box ready for gift-giving. Artist Susan Lordi hand carves the original of each Willow Tree piece from her studio in Kansas City, MO. This piece is cast based on Susan's original carving and painted by hand. Brown elastic cord for hanging. To clean, dust with soft brush or cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614XXJyPSJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow Tree","source_asin":"B0011FN9TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-471872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0011FN9TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0011FN9TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
